WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.100
Haddad will implement the monthly transit pass.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.100
With it, you'll ride public transit as much as you want,

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.100
all month long, including weekends and holidays.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.100
With the money you spend going from home to work

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.100
and from work back home, you'll be able to work, study,

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:23.100
go out, hit the park, the stadium, the movies, meet friends -

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.100
you'll be able to go wherever you want.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.100
Think new. Think Haddad.
